%% STATUS: TARGET (proposed, not implemented)
sequenceDiagram
  participant CI as CI or operator
  participant R as Evaluation runner
  participant DS as Versioned dataset
  participant P as Turn pipeline
  participant SC as Deterministic scorers
  participant J as LLM judge
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant G as Gate checker
  CI->>R: Run with dataset, prompt, policy and model versions
  R->>DS: Load and verify dataset hash
  R->>DB: Create run record
  loop Each case
    R->>P: Input, synthetic data only
    P-->>R: Response, safety result, routing, citations, timings
    R->>SC: Assertions
    SC-->>R: Pass or fail with reason
    opt Subjective quality metric
      R->>J: Response and rubric
      J-->>R: Score and rationale
    end
    R->>DB: Save case result
  end
  R->>G: Compare aggregates and cases to baseline
  alt Any critical safety case regressed
    G-->>CI: Block, regardless of aggregate score
  else Thresholds not met
    G-->>CI: Block with failed metrics
  else All gates pass
    G-->>CI: Allow
  end
